      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="introduction">
        <tei:p>This is a seliḥah in piyut form. The first line borrows from the famous seliḥah במוצאי מנוחה. The seliḥah is driven by the question: How can we ask for forgiveness as the death and destruction in Gaza continues?</tei:p>
